Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.50,1:48:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《蚁人》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0005,,(1989年)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.40,0:00:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯塔克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他看起来不太高兴\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't seem happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.61,0:00:23.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 汉克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.89,0:00:26.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在应该是在莫斯科的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're supposed to be in Moscow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:29.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我绕了个道\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took a detour...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:31.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,经过了你的防御实验室\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Through your defense lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我这不是我想的那个东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me that isn't what I think it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.49,0:00:39.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这取决于你们是否承认在复制我的研究成果\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That depends if you think it's a poor attempt to replicate my work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使是为了公司 你们也太胆大妄为了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even for this group, that takes nerve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你被命令去苏联\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were instructed to go to Russia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.65,0:00:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要我提醒你吗 皮姆博士 你是一名军人…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I remind you, Dr. Pym, that you're a soldier...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是科学家\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a scientist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.96,0:00:49.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就表现得像个科学家\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then act like one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.39,0:00:52.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮姆粒子是最具革命性的研究发现\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Pym Particle is the most revolutionary science ever developed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.29,0:00:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帮我们好好利用它\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help us put it to good use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.53,0:00:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把我当成跑腿的也就算了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I let you turn me into your errand boy,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.70,0:00:58.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你还想偷走我的科研成果吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now you try to steal my research?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.39,0:01:02.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你当初这么拼命地保护珍妮特就好了 皮姆博士\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only you'd protected Janet with such ferocity, Dr. Pym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.57,0:01:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点 汉克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.95,0:01:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你胆敢再提到我的妻子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mention my wife again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.49,0:01:14.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会让你见识到 什么叫做拼命\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll show you ferocity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.83,0:01:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别看我 你自己说的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at me. You said it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:19.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在正式提出辞职\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I formally tender my resignation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:22.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也正式的表示 不接受\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't accept it. Formally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.07,0:01:23.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.43,0:01:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.24,0:01:27.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮姆粒子是个奇迹 求你了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Pym Particle is a miracle. Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.87,0:01:30.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别让你的过去决定你的未来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let your past determine the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:33.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我还活着\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As long as I am alive,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.24,0:01:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人可以得到那个公式\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nobody will ever get that formula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.85,0:01:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不应该让他离开这座大厦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shouldn't let him leave the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.93,0:01:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们已经骗了他 现在还想对他开战吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've already lied to him. Now you want to go to war with him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:49.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.89,0:01:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的科研人员根本没法复制他的实验成果\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our scientists haven't come close to replicating his work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.69,0:01:55.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,相同体型下 你根本不是他的对手\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just kicked your ass, full-size.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.23,0:01:58.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的想再试试 看不见他是什么情形吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really want to find out what it's like when you can't see him coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.67,0:02:00.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认识汉克·皮姆很久了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've known Hank Pym for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.30,0:02:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是危险分子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's no security risk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.80,0:02:05.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非我们激怒了他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless we make him one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.75,0:02:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0005,,(现今)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.41,0:02:45.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.95,0:02:47.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:48.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喜欢就来尝尝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come get you some now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.39,0:03:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么没有反应\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't even move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.89,0:03:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没反应\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.22,0:03:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我从左边开打呢 下面这里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if I come in on the left side, right? Just down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.69,0:03:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看见这里了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see this right here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.94,0:03:16.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会想你的 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna miss you, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也会想你的 皮奇\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna miss you, too, Peachy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.01,0:03:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计 你们的欢送仪式太奇怪了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, you guys got the weirdest goodbye rituals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.65,0:03:24.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啦 散啦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, break it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,散啦 散啦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break it up! Break it up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.35,0:03:38.71,Default,,0000,0000,0005,,(圣昆廷监狱)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.90,0:03:45.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.44,0:03:47.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 兄弟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's up, man!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.07,0:03:48.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我靠 嘿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn! Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:50.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哈哈 嘿 兄弟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha-ha! Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:54.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你眼睛怎么了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's up with your eye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.68,0:03:57.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还能怎么样 皮奇干的 算是告别礼物\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Well, what do you think? Peachy. It's a going-away present.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.52,0:03:59.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对哦 我一年前留下的伤疤还在呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. I still got my scar from a year ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 我依旧是唯一将他击倒的人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? I'm still the only one who knocked him out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.72,0:04:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我肯定不行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I definitely didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.59,0:04:09.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你来接我 兄弟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for picking me up, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.43,0:04:11.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟 你觉得我会错过狱友出狱吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bro, you think I'm gonna miss my celly getting out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.60,0:04:12.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 你女朋友怎么样了 兄弟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how's your girl, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.77,0:04:13.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她把我给甩了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, she left me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.13,0:04:15.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.67,0:04:16.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我妈妈死了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, my ma died, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.84,0:04:19.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爸爸也被驱逐出境了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my dad got deported.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.64,0:04:21.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我还有这辆面包车\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I got the van!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.91,0:04:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,挺不错的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.01,0:04:24.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可不是嘛\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.11,0:04:26.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你让我借住 我正需要有个地方住呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for the hook-up, too. I needed a place to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.72,0:04:28.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等到你看见那张沙发再谢我吧 你会非常喜欢的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wait till you see this couch. You're gonna be really happy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:30.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,躺下就不想起来了 看着吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be on your feet in no time. Watch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 希望如此 - 是啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I hope so. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:33.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还会介绍几个人给你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I gotta introduce you to some people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.46,0:04:34.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一些技术很棒的人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some really skilled people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.72,0:04:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 没兴趣 - 好吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Not interested. - Yeah, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.22,0:04:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我是认真的 兄弟 我可不想再回头了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm serious, man. I'm not going back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.69,0:04:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有个女儿要照顾\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a daughter to take care of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:44.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道犯有前科的人找工作可不容易 对吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that jobs don't come easy for ex-cons, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.66,0:04:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 兄弟 我有电气工程硕士学位\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, man, I got a master's in electrical engineering, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.13,0:04:49.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会没事的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna be fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.87,0:04:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎光临芭斯罗缤\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Baskin-Robbins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:56.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想试试我们的芒果冰沙吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like to try our Mango Fruit Blast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.11,0:04:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用了 谢谢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, no, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.68,0:05:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃 我要一个… 我要一个汉堡 谢谢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um, I will have... I'll have a burger, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:03.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有… 我们不卖这个\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we don't... We don't make that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.22,0:05:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,椒盐卷饼 热的 加芥末的… 你们有芥末蘸酱吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pretzel. Hot pretzel. Like, mustard... Do you have mustard dip?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.52,0:05:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里是卖冰激凌的 芭斯罗缤\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's ice cream. Baskin-Robbins.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.96,0:05:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就 随便来点新鲜出炉的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just do, like, whatever's hot and fresh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.23,0:05:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.76,0:05:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到我办公室来一下 马上\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I see you in the back, chief? Pronto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.56,0:05:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 戴尔\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure thing, Dale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.13,0:05:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戴比 能过来接待一下这个白痴吗 谢谢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darby, could you just, uh, take care of this idiot? Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 戴尔\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Dale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.16,0:05:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请进\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.27,0:05:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找把椅子坐\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull up some chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.08,0:05:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在圣昆廷坐了三年牢 对吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three years at San Quentin, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.51,0:05:33.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你查到了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You found out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.78,0:05:35.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芭斯罗缤总会查到的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baskin-Robbins always finds out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.92,0:05:38.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我很抱歉 但我…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm sorry, all right? But I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.78,0:05:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没人愿意雇我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one would hire me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.05,0:05:42.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非法闯入 重大盗窃案\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breaking and entering. Grand larceny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:44.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 我很抱歉\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.92,0:05:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不会再干了 我只是… - 向你致意\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't do it anymore. I just... - Respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.32,0:05:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我别提有多高兴了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't be happier about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.83,0:05:51.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真的吗 - 真的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:53.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢 谢谢你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.27,0:05:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定教训了那些狗娘养的亿万富翁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really stuck it to those billionaire SOBs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我越了解你都做过了些什么…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The more I read about what you did and stuff...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.70,0:06:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就越会想 "我居然认识这家伙"\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm like, "Wow, I know this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:03.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我竟然是这家伙的上司"\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"I'm in charge of this guy?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做这份工作很开心\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm very happy in this job,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.91,0:06:08.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很珍惜这个机会…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I really just appreciate the opportunity to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.08,0:06:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 你被开除了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're fired, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.98,0:06:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我实在无法留你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't really keep you on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.62,0:06:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 什么 开除\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, what? Fired?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:16.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.29,0:06:18.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔 听着 那不是暴力犯罪 我是个好员工\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dale, look, it wasn't a violent crime. I mean, I'm a good worker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.89,0:06:21.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 那当然不是暴力犯罪 那是超酷的犯罪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it wasn't a violent crime. It was a cool crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:23.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我要告诉你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些将不会被记录在案底\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will be totally off the books, off the records,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.23,0:06:29.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下你卷铺盖走人的时候\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if you want to grab one of those Mango Fruit Blasts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.10,0:06:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果想顺走一个芒果冰沙\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on your way out the door,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.70,0:06:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会假装没看见的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just pretend I didn't see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.61,0:06:48.51,Default,,0000,0000,0005,,(米格罗姆酒店)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.68,0:07:13.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 斯科特 你好啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Scotty. What's up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.38,0:07:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为你在上班的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were supposed to be at work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.18,0:07:17.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上了 但我被开除了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was. I got fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.08,0:07:18.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 他们查到你是谁了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn. They find out who you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.92,0:07:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.29,0:07:22.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芭斯罗缤总会查到的 兄弟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baskin-Robbins always finds out, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.05,0:07:23.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,芭斯罗缤可不是闹着玩的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baskin-Robbins don't play.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.86,0:07:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要来点华夫饼吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want some waffles?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.73,0:07:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好啊 那就来点华夫饼\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'll take a waffle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.19,0:07:28.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是库尔特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. That's Kurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.00,0:07:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在福尔瑟姆监狱待了五年 他可是个电脑奇才\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was Folsom for five years. He's a wizard on that laptop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.93,0:07:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴认识你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice meet you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.20,0:07:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,认识你我也很高兴\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Nice to meet you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.23,0:07:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.67,0:07:37.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戴夫\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.01,0:07:40.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维斯塔公司那一票干得漂亮\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice work on the Vista job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.71,0:07:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维斯塔那票 对\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vista job, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.11,0:07:45.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听说过那起抢劫\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. I have heard of this robbery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.85,0:07:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,严格来说 我没有抢劫 抢劫涉及威胁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, technically, I didn't rob them. Robbery involves threat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:51.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我讨厌暴力 我那叫入室盗窃 我只是个飞贼\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate violence. I burgled them. I'm a cat burglar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.88,0:07:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你意思是 你是个娘们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean you're a pussy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.53,0:07:56.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维斯塔公司高价宰客 对吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were overcharging the customers, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:57.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,加起来有几百万了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it added up to millions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:08:00.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他揭发后却被开除了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He blows the whistle and he gets fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.26,0:08:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后你猜他怎么着\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what does he do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.83,0:08:03.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他黑进了公司的安全系统\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He hacks into the security system{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.86,0:08:06.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把那几百万转账还给了那些被坑的客户\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and transfers millions back to the people that they stole it from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还把所有的银行交易记录发布到了网上\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Posts all the bank records online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:10.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他开着那家伙的宾利冲进了他的游泳池里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he drove the dude's Bentley into his swimming pool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.21,0:08:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这是在干嘛\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.18,0:08:19.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么把我的事告诉这些人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you telling my life story to these guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.31,0:08:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想干什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.45,0:08:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我表哥两周前跟这家伙谈过\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My cousin talked to this guy two weeks ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.25,0:08:25.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个超级棒的小活\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about this little perfect job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.65,0:08:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没门\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.87,0:08:29.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 等等 那家伙… 那家伙完全对你的口味\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. Wait! This guy... This guy fits your M.O.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.06,0:08:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.42,0:08:32.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我金盆洗手了 兄弟 我不想再回监狱里去了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm finished, man. I'm not going back to jail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.73,0:08:34.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是个靠退休金生活的百万富翁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's some retired millionaire living off his golden parachute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:36.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可是斯科特·朗的完美目标\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a perfect Scott Lang mark!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.86,0:08:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎 我不干\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care. I'm out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.72,0:08:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮姆博士\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Pym?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.88,0:09:01.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我还活着\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes. I'm still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,身份卡\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ID?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.20,0:09:12.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个应该就能证明了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps that will suffice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.13,0:09:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常抱歉 先生 请进\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very sorry, sir. Please come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.51,0:09:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是汉克·皮姆吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that Hank Pym?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.75,0:09:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早上好 汉克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good morning, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.08,0:09:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍普\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:32.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫我一声爸爸会死吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would it kill you to call me Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:34.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克罗斯博士肯定非常高兴\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Cross will be so pleased that{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.29,0:09:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天你能过来加入我们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you could find the time to join us today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.02,0:09:38.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,更确切的说是:"欣喜若狂"\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More like "thrilled."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:42.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很意外能收到你发来的邀请信 达伦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was surprised to receive any kind of invitation from you, Darren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.86,0:09:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天是什么日子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the occasion?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:46.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一会你就知道 对吗 霍普\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you'll see. Won't he, Hope?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.54,0:09:52.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在里面已经为你准备好了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're ready for you inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.24,0:09:54.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哎呦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ouch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.51,0:09:59.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜有些旧伤口愈合不了 对吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess some old wounds never heal, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.25,0:10:00.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心 她会得到很好的照顾\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, she's in good hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.48,0:10:04.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会喜欢的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in for a treat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.39,0:10:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好久不见 皮姆博士 退休生活还好吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Long time, no see, Dr. Pym. How's retirement?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的脸还好吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's your face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:18.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你先请\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:29.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在我们开始之前 我想先介绍一位特殊来宾\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, before we start, I'd like to introduce a very special guest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.24,0:10:31.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本公司的创始人 也是我的导师\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This company's founder and my mentor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉克·皮姆博士\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Hank Pym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.93,0:10:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我从皮姆博士那里接手这家公司后\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I took over this company for Dr. Pym,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我立即开始研究一种\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I immediately started researching a particle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.23,0:10:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能够改变原子间距离\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that could change the distance between atoms,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.10,0:10:59.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,同时能增加密度和强度的粒子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while increasing density and strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.44,0:11:02.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这个革命性创意一直被\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why this revolutionary idea remained buried{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉克雪藏在灰尘和蛛网之下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beneath the dust and cobwebs of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:06.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没法告诉你们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank's research, I couldn't tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.95,0:11:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过设想一下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But just imagine,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.95,0:11:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个昆虫般大小的战士\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a soldier the size of an insect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.49,0:11:17.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一件终极秘密武器\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ultimate secret weapon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.97,0:11:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个蚁人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An Ant-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.54,0:11:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们以前就这么称呼你的 对吧 汉克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what they called you. Right, Hank?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很傻的名字 我知道\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Silly, I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.18,0:11:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宣传需要罢了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Propaganda.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.12,0:11:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,类似惊奇故事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tales to astonish!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.32,0:11:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,胡编乱造用来吓唬苏联人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trumped-up BS to scare the USSR.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.55,0:11:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉克 你可否告诉客人们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank, will you tell our guests what you told me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.29,0:11:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每次我问你"真的有蚁人吗"时\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every single time I asked you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.36,0:11:59.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是如何回答的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Was the Ant-Man real?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.97,0:12:01.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是个传说罢了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just a tall tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.54,0:12:05.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这么神奇的东西怎么可能会是真的呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because how could anything so miraculous possibly be real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.48,0:12:20.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我被蚁人的传说激发了灵感\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I was inspired by the legend of the Ant-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:23.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,随着我在非有机材料缩小技术上有所突破\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And with my breakthrough shrinking inorganic material,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.09,0:12:25.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就在想 缩小人类是否可行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought, could it be possible to shrink a person?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.03,0:12:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,究竟能不能做到\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could that be done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实那已不再是传说\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it's not a legend anymore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尊敬的客人们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Distinguished guests,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.14,0:12:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我骄傲的向你们展示当代战争的终结者\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am proud to present the end of warfare as we know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.04,0:12:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黄蜂战衣\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Yellowjacket!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.61,0:12:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.32,0:12:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黄蜂战衣是一种全能的战争武器\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Yellowjacket is an all-purpose weapon of war{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.65,0:12:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以改变穿戴者的大小\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}capable of altering the size of the wearer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.29,0:12:58.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以获得终极的战斗优势\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the ultimate combat advantage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.26,0:13:01.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们生活在\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We live in an era{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:03.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个用武器自卫却不断受到\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in which the weapons we use to protect ourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实时监控破坏的时代\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are undermined by constant surveillance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.20,0:13:08.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是时候回归更简单的时代了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to return to a simpler age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:11.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个可以用自由力量光明正大\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One where the powers of freedom can once again operate openly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.74,0:13:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保护自身权益的时代\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to protect their interests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.97,0:13:16.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作为一件全能型和平卫士的可穿戴物\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An all-purpose peace-keeping vessel,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.24,0:13:18.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黄蜂战衣可以应付\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Yellowjacket can manage any conflict{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:20.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地缘政治环境中的任何冲突\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the geopolitical landscape{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.11,0:13:22.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而不被发现\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}completely unseen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.72,0:13:26.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,高效执行预防性举措和战术性进攻\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Efficient in both preventative measures and tactical assault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.72,0:13:29.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,实用范围包括监视\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Practical applications include surveillance,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,工业破坏\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}industrial sabotage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.32,0:13:36.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以及铲除通往和平途中的所有障碍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the elimination of obstructions on the road to peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一件黄蜂战衣\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A single Yellowjacket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.20,0:13:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,使用者就可以拥有无限潜能\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}offers the user unlimited influence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.00,0:13:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以实施防御举措\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to carry out protective actions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.47,0:13:45.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不久的将来 一个黄蜂战衣的军队\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, one day soon, an army of Yellowjackets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.24,0:13:47.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将会在全世界创造出一个\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will create a sustainable environment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.71,0:13:50.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸福安康的可持续环境\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of well-being around the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黄蜂战衣\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Yellowjacket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.11,0:13:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 只是件衣服\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, it's a suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.32,0:14:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别那么轻率 弗兰克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be crude, Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.12,0:14:03.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是普通的衣服 而是载体\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a suit, it's a vessel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.66,0:14:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 没能打动你吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? You're not impressed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.29,0:14:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不只打动了我 还把我吓到了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm impressed. I'm also concerned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.23,0:14:11.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想象一下 如果我们的敌人掌握了这种技术会干出什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Imagine what our enemies could do with this tech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.30,0:14:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个问题我们回头再详细谈 弗兰克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should have a longer conversation about that, Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.77,0:14:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的很重视你的意见\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I really value your opinion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.44,0:14:19.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢各位的到来 霍普\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for coming. Hope?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.07,0:14:21.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢大家 我送你们出去\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you very much, everybody. I will escort you out now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.54,0:14:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.18,0:14:27.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来有点震惊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem a bit shocked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.81,0:14:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达伦 我当初把这秘密埋藏起来是有原因的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darren, there's a reason that I buried these secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:35.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以你终于承认了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you finally admit it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.09,0:14:38.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来可以合作的 汉克 可你把那机会毁掉了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could have done this together, Hank. But you ruined that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因此你是过去 而我将是未来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why you're the past and I'm the future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.03,0:14:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停手吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.56,0:14:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克罗斯博士\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Cross?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:49.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你先卖给我 价钱可以再多给你百分之二十\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sell to me first, 20% over your asking price,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:51.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,两周之内你就可以拿到现金\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can have the cash here in two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.30,0:14:52.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成交\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.38,0:15:03.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得采取行动了 汉克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to make our move, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.48,0:15:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他进展到哪一步了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How close is he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.75,0:15:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他仍然不能缩小活物\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He still can't shrink a live subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.45,0:15:10.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把套战服给我 让我彻底了结这事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me the suit and let me finish this once and for all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:13.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克罗斯现在完全信任我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have Cross' complete trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.19,0:15:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太危险了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.33,0:15:16.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有选择\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.10,0:15:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,话可别说得那么绝对\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's not entirely true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.17,0:15:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我有人选了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I found a guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.34,0:15:24.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.17,0:15:30.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小花生 哦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peanut! Oh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.11,0:15:34.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,生日快乐\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Happy birthday!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.36,0:15:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真抱歉我来晚了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so sorry I'm late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.71,0:15:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道聚会几点开始\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know what time your party started.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.32,0:15:38.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请柬上有写啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was on the invitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:40.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没给他发请柬\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't get an invitation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.55,0:15:42.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他还是来了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he came anyway!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想错过我宝贝女儿的生日派对\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I'm not gonna miss my little girl's birthday party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.39,0:15:47.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去告诉妈妈你来了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna go tell Mommy you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.23,0:15:48.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你别…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you don't...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:49.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里干嘛 朗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here, Lang?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.50,0:15:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,孩子的抚养费你一毛钱都没给过\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You haven't paid a dime of child support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.12,0:15:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 如果我愿意 现在就可以逮捕你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, right now, if I wanted to, I could arrest you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你 帕克斯顿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to see you too, Paxton.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.30,0:15:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈听说你来了 高兴得喝水都呛着了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy's so happy you're here, she choked on her drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.50,0:16:01.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看我给你带了什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look what I have for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.37,0:16:02.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在能打开吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I open it now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.81,0:16:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 小宝贝 今天是你生日\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, sweetheart. It's your birthday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.25,0:16:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我最最好的朋友\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my bestest friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.58,0:16:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这什么玩意\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.82,0:16:13.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他好丑\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's so ugly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.25,0:16:16.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱死他了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.36,0:16:17.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能拿去给小伙伴们看吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I go show my friends?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:20.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然 宝贝儿 去吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, sweetheart. Go ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.56,0:16:22.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我最最好的朋友\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my bestest friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.23,0:16:24.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 孩子的抚养费我会给你的 好吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, the child support is coming, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.46,0:16:26.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是有前科的人找工作不容易\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just hard finding a job when you have a record.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.57,0:16:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你会有办法的 但是现在 我要你离开我家\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you'll figure it out. But for now, I want you out of my house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.37,0:16:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不可能 今天是我女儿生日 - 这是我家\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No way! It's my daughter's birthday. - It's my house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.77,0:16:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那又怎样 她是我的孩子 - 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So what? It's my kid! - Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.57,0:16:35.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能想来就来 你知道的 走吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't just show up here. You know that. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.77,0:16:37.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可这是生日聚会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a birthday party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.28,0:16:38.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 我知道 那你也不能想来就来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know, but you can't just show up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.74,0:16:40.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我女儿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.25,0:16:41.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本不知道如何做父亲\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know the first thing about being a father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.58,0:16:43.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬 我以朋友的身份\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie, I tell you this as a friend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.55,0:16:45.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,并看在你是我初恋的份上告诉你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and as the first love of my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.38,0:16:47.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你未婚夫是个傻帽\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your fiance is an asshat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:48.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他不是傻帽\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not an asshat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.75,0:16:50.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 说话注意点 行吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, watch your language. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.29,0:16:51.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说话怎么了 我说的是"帽"\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What language? I said "hat."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.52,0:16:52.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住嘴\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.36,0:16:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是认真的吗 玛姬 就那家伙\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really, Maggie? That guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.50,0:16:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 你嫁给谁不行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! You could marry anyone you want,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:16:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,偏偏要嫁给警察\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you have to get engaged to a cop?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少他不是罪犯\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least he's not a crook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在努力 好吗 我改了 改邪归正了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm trying, okay? I've changed. I'm straight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.74,0:17:07.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有过工作而且…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a job and...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.64,0:17:11.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要抚养女儿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna provide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.04,0:17:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花了很多时间考虑过 并且我爱她\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a lot of time to think about it and I love her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.38,0:17:15.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常爱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.11,0:17:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我错过了太多时间 我想成为她生活的一部分\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've missed so much time and I wanna be a part of her life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.85,0:17:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我该怎么做\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.65,0:17:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,租个房子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get an apartment,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.49,0:17:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找个工作 付抚养费\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get a job, pay child support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.99,0:17:27.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那时我们再来谈探视权 我保证\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then we will talk about visitation, I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.73,0:17:30.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是她的英雄 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're her hero, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.86,0:17:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好好保持你在她心目中的形象\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just be the person that she already thinks you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.49,0:18:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉让你对黄蜂战衣担忧了 弗兰克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry you have such deep concerns about the Yellowjacket, Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.29,0:18:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Well, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.36,0:18:08.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惜 我们都不能为所欲为\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, we can't just do whatever we want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.53,0:18:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那倒是好 对吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'd be nice though, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.50,0:18:13.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但还是要遵从法律\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there are laws.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.97,0:18:15.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么法律 人类的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What laws? Of man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.77,0:18:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自然的法则高于人类的法律\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The laws of nature transcend the laws of man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.31,0:18:20.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我已经超越了自然的法则\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I've transcended the laws of nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.75,0:18:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达伦 看来你没明白…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darren, I don't think you understand...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.45,0:18:30.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.92,0:18:34.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来我们的技术仍有漏洞\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still haven't worked out all the bugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:41.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见了 弗兰克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, Frank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.48,0:18:56.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.45,0:19:03.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 我最近经常思考感恩的含义\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I've been thinking a lot about gratitude lately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.89,0:19:06.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我晨间冥想时\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And today, during my morning meditation,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,产生了个有趣的想法\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an interesting thought occurred to me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.02,0:19:09.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得也适用于你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I think it might apply to you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.54,0:19:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此话怎讲\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.74,0:19:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感恩可以是宽恕\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gratitude can be forgiveness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.07,0:19:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么多年来我一直在生汉克·皮姆的气\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've spent years carrying around my anger for Hank Pym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.57,0:19:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把自己的才华都贡献给了他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I devoted my genius to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本来我去哪工作都可以\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have worked anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我偏偏没选好导师\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I chose my mentor poorly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.44,0:19:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而你却连选择都没有\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't even have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.75,0:19:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从不信任你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He never believed in you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我为咱们所做的事感到惭愧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame what we had to do,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.62,0:19:36.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但都是他逼的 对吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he forced us to do it, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.09,0:19:39.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我们不应该愤怒 而是应该感恩\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we shouldn't be angry, we should be grateful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他是一个失败的导师\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because his failures as a mentor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.83,0:19:45.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个失败的父亲\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as a father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是他逼得我们展翅高飞\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}forced us to spread our wings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.50,0:19:54.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是成功的 达伦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a success, Darren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.41,0:19:56.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将来的一切都是你应得的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You deserve everything coming your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.92,0:20:14.35,Default,,0000,0000,0005,,(377天后才能见凯茜)
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.66,0:20:17.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ooh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.86,0:20:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别耍赖\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop cheating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.53,0:20:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 回来了 高手\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, what's up, hotshot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.40,0:20:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可能没听见\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe he didn't hear you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.17,0:20:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,聚会还好吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was the party?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.01,0:20:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我说说那一票应该怎么干\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about that tip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.15,0:20:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.78,0:20:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道那一票应该怎么干\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna know about that tip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.82,0:20:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 宝贝儿 开工了 立刻开工\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, baby, it's on! It's so on, right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.42,0:20:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先别激动 好吗 我需要知道这票到底是什么来头\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down, all right? I just need to know where it came from.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,必须做得天衣无缝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gotta be airtight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.79,0:20:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.19,0:20:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在一个品酒会上遇到了我表哥埃内斯托\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was at a wine tasting with my cousin Ernesto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.59,0:20:50.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主要是红酒 你知道我不太喜欢喝红酒的 哥们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which was mainly reds, and you know I don't like reds, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.96,0:20:53.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那天有一种桃红酒 非常好喝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there was a rose that saved the day. It was delightful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.17,0:20:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他跟我提到了一个女孩\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then he tells me about this girl,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:56.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫艾米丽 我们以前泡过的妞\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Emily, that we used to kick it with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:20:58.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,其实我第一次摸到的胸部就是她的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was actually the first pair of boobs I ever touched.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.22,0:20:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想听这些细节\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the wrong details.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.84,0:21:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些都跟主题无关\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has nothing to do with the story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.47,0:21:03.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,继续说\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.18,0:21:05.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我说 那个叫艾米丽的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, uh, he tells me that she's{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.44,0:21:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她现在当钟点工 知道吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}working as a housekeeper now, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.08,0:21:08.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后她跟一个叫卡洛斯的搞对象\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she's dating this dude, Carlos,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:11.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是湾区那边的一个帮派头子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who's a shot caller from across the bay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.22,0:21:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她把雇主家的情况全盘告诉给了卡洛斯\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she tells him about the dude that she's cleaning for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.62,0:21:16.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧 那雇主好像是一个大公司的总裁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right? That he's like this big-shot CEO{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.09,0:21:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在退休了 但有的是钱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is all retired now, but he's loaded.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后 卡洛斯和埃内斯托是同一个垒球队的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so, Carlos and Ernesto are on the same softball team,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.83,0:21:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是他们聊开了 懂吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they get to talking, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接下来就是重头戏了 卡洛斯说 嘿 伙计\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And here comes the good part. Carlos says, "Yo, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.07,0:21:29.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙有个体积巨大的保险箱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy's got a big-ass safe just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.20,0:21:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就在地下室里 简直棒极了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sitting in the basement, just chilling."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.24,0:21:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毫无疑问埃内斯托把这件事告诉了我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course Ernesto comes to me because{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.64,0:21:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他知道我偷盗技术了得\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he knows I got mad thieving skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:35.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后 我问他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course, I ask him...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:36.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾米丽有没有通过卡洛斯告诉你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Did Emily tell Carlos to tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.78,0:21:38.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保险箱是什么样的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"to get to me what kind of safe it was?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.64,0:21:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他说 没有 老兄\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he says, "Nah, dawg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.55,0:21:42.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她只说是个超级坚固的那种\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All she said is that it's super-legit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.51,0:21:44.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管里面是什么 肯定很值钱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and whatever's in it, it's gotta be good."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.05,0:21:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.12,0:21:50.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老头子有个保险箱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old man have safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.79,0:21:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他要外出一星期\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's gone for a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.12,0:21:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白了 一个老头 他有个保险箱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. There's an old man, he's got a safe,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他要外出一星期\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he's gone for a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.06,0:21:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 干他一票\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just work with that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.23,0:21:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是这个意思\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what I'm saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.01,0:22:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,座机信号切断了 手机信号也瘫痪了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Landline's cut, cell signal's jammed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.95,0:22:53.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚没人能报警了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one will be making for distress call tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.15,0:22:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通讯检查\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Comm check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.22,0:22:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 检查 - 检查\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Check. - Check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.95,0:22:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你失手了 别忘了你还有我这个后援\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, if the job goes bad, you know I got your back, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.69,0:22:58.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.02,0:23:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不会有这种事的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.90,0:23:05.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就是喜欢他自信满满的样子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love it when he gets cocky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.30,0:23:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,厉害\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.60,0:23:41.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,报警系统给废了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alarm is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.67,0:23:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.04,0:23:47.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我正在穿过房间\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I'm moving through the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.36,0:24:14.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,门上有个指纹锁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a fingerprint lock on the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.73,0:24:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有个什么 埃内斯托可没告诉我这些\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's got what? Ernesto didn't tell me nothing about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.00,0:24:19.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟 我们没戏了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw, man, are we screwed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.17,0:24:21.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那可不一定\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not necessarily.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.09,0:25:10.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我进来了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.82,0:25:13.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有触发警报 对他而言简直是小菜一碟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No alarms have been triggered. He's in like the Flynn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.30,0:25:19.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 天呐\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.16,0:25:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.30,0:25:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来他们没骗我们 这保险箱真是固若金汤\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, they weren't kidding. This safe is serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.17,0:25:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有多坚固 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How serious are we talking, Scotty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.24,0:25:27.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,产自卡本代尔\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Carbondale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.01,0:25:29.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,1910年生产的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's from 1910.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.71,0:25:32.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和泰坦尼克号用的同样的材料\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Made from the same steel as the Titanic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.34,0:25:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.88,0:25:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能打开它吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you crack it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.68,0:25:38.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的 这玩意耐寒性不怎么样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here's the thing. It doesn't do so well in the cold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.63,0:25:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还记得撞冰山的事情吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what that iceberg did?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.12,0:25:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了 伙计 把小李子给淹死了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, man. It killed DiCaprio.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.82,0:25:43.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,淹死了所有人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killed everybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.09,0:25:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有淹死那个老太太\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did not kill the old lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.72,0:25:46.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她最后还把宝石扔到海里了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She still throw the jewel into the oceans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.18,0:26:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你做了什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.18,0:26:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我往锁芯里注水 然后用液氮冷冻\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I poured water in the locking mechanism and froze it with nitrogen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.95,0:26:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冰会膨胀 金属可不会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ice expands. Metal doesn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.55,0:26:48.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那你现在在干嘛 - 在等\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing now? - Waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.12,0:26:51.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在等\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.36,0:27:00.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不错\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.80,0:27:06.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,里面有什么 钞票 珠宝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? Cash? Jewels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.51,0:27:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 里面什么都没有 - 你说什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's nothing here. - What did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.11,0:27:12.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有一套衣服\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.30,0:27:13.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.51,0:27:15.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是一套旧的机车服\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's an old motorcycle suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.45,0:27:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有钞票 没有珠宝 什么都没有吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no cash, no jewelry, nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.42,0:27:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.92,0:27:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们扑了个空\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.99,0:27:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是对不住 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really sorry, Scotty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.36,0:27:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明白你想要捞一票\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you needed to score.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.13,0:28:02.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为我们要用老鼠\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought we were using mice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.09,0:28:04.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么区别吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the difference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.00,0:28:10.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备34-C号实验 缩小有机原子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Commence Experiment 34-C. Organic atomic reduction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.97,0:28:12.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达伦 也许我们该再考虑一下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darren, maybe we should think...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.87,0:28:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,缩小有机组织是这项技术的核心\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shrinking organic tissue is the centerpiece of this technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.21,0:28:17.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不能把半成品交给买家\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't go to the buyers with half a breakthrough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.53,0:28:46.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,34-C号试验\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Experiment 34-C results,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.07,0:28:47.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失败\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}negative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.48,0:28:54.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给实验台消毒 把35-C号实验对象带来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sanitize the work station. Bring in subject 35-C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.29,0:29:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你会把这个锁起来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you lock this up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.35,0:29:31.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是奇怪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is so weird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.55,0:30:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scotty, what's up, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.46,0:30:12.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想知道 这是什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder... What is this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.19,0:30:44.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从这个角度看世界\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world sure seems different{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.02,0:30:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还真是不一样 是不是 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from down here, doesn't it, Scott?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.62,0:30:49.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 谁在说话\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Who said that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.47,0:30:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路易斯 我在下面\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luis, down here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.24,0:31:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是一次艰难的考验 斯科特 或者说\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a trial by fire, Scott. Or, in this case,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.07,0:31:02.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是来自水的考验\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.56,0:31:28.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来你比想象中的要厉害\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess you're tougher than you thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.47,0:31:32.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不想看你脱衣服\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, I don't want to see this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.50,0:31:34.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路易斯\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.68,0:31:40.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,混蛋\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.82,0:32:59.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.59,0:33:02.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,初次试验还不错\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not bad for a test drive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.86,0:33:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保管好衣服 我还会和你联系的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the suit. I'll be in touch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.23,0:33:07.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 不 不 不用了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No! No, thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.48,0:33:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,趴在地上\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down on the ground!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.48,0:33:23.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你被捕了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are under arrest!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:25.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有偷东西 我是来还我偷的东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I didn't steal anything! I was returning something I stole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.82,0:33:26.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.35,0:33:30.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不许动\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.89,0:33:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 我们差点都相信\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you almost had us convinced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.43,0:33:38.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你改过自新了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you were gonna change your ways.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.83,0:33:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,母女俩都很看好你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were really rooting for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.60,0:33:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这会伤了她们的心的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna break their hearts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.37,0:33:48.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人来探视你了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a visitor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.67,0:33:50.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.21,0:33:51.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的律师\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your lawyer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.21,0:33:53.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的律师\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lawyer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.68,0:33:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过我还会跟你联系的 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I'd be in touch, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.88,0:34:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想你是不是比较喜欢蹲局子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm starting to think that you prefer the inside of a jail cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.22,0:34:05.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.76,0:34:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.76,0:34:13.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,先生 我很抱歉我偷了你的衣服\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, I'm sorry I stole the suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.86,0:34:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至不知道为什么你会拥有那件衣服\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't even wanna know why you have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.60,0:34:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬没看错你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maggie was right about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.37,0:34:20.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道玛姬\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know about...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.87,0:34:22.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难怪她不让你接近凯茜\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No wonder she's trying to keep you away from Cassie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.54,0:34:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每当事情得不到很好的解决\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The moment things get hard,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.54,0:34:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就会走老路去犯罪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you turn right back to crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.48,0:34:31.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过要我说 你还是有选择的余地的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The way I see it, you have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.75,0:34:33.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么你选择在监狱里度过余生\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can either spend the rest of your life in prison,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.02,0:34:37.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要么你先回拘留室\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or go back to your cell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.66,0:34:39.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等我下一步的指令\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and await further instructions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.99,0:34:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没搞明白\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.53,0:34:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也没指望你明白\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't expect you to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.93,0:34:46.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过你现在没别的选择了 而且老实说\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you don't have many options right now, and quite frankly,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.86,0:34:49.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也一样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}neither do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.50,0:34:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你没想过 一开始就是我布局让你偷战服的吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think I let you steal that suit in the first place?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.00,0:34:54.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.62,0:35:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样的机会可不是经常都有的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second chances don't come around all that much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.75,0:35:11.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 如果你遇到了这样的机会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, next time you think you might see one,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.06,0:35:15.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我建议你最好认真仔细的考虑一下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you take a real close look at it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.61,0:35:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我最好的朋友\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my bestest friend!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.84,0:35:31.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的不要换一个玩具吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you don't want a different toy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.71,0:35:34.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我就喜欢这个\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I love this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.48,0:35:36.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 快睡吧 我爱你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Well, get some sleep. I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.62,0:35:39.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 妈妈 - 怎么了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mommy? - Hmm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.32,0:35:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸真的是坏人吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is Daddy a bad man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.02,0:35:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听一些大人说他很坏\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard some grownups say he's bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.66,0:35:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.03,0:35:50.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸只是有时候犯糊涂 你明白吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Daddy just gets confused sometimes, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.51,0:36:45.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明智的选择 你终于开窍了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smart choice. You actually listened, for once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.55,0:36:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从门下面走\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Under the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.79,0:36:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 现在去哪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, where to now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.16,0:36:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 稍等 - 哦 天呐\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hang tight. - Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.96,0:37:00.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你说什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.06,0:37:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他到底跑哪去了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the hell did he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.30,0:37:02.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 他就这么凭空消失了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea. He just vanished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.72,0:37:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,立刻封锁附近五个街区 马上\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set up a five-block perimeter. Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.69,0:37:06.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,退后 退后\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back! Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.50,0:37:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯科特 这些是我的伙伴\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scott, these are my associates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.87,0:37:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蚂蚁身上装了摄像头吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that a camera on an ant?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.61,0:37:12.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 不然呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sure. Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.58,0:37:13.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,车在哪里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.81,0:37:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有车 我们用翅膀\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No car. We've got wings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.18,0:37:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incoming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.59,0:37:29.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,脚踩在中间那节 然后骑到它胸部\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your foot on the central node and mount the thorax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.73,0:37:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这玩意安全 - 赶紧骑上去 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How safe is... - Just get on the damn ant, Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.78,0:37:46.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么在警车上\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am I on a police car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.64,0:37:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是不应该在警车上吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't I not be on a police car?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.21,0:37:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样你们就能搭顺风车\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they can give you a lift{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.41,0:37:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,穿过五个街区的封锁了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}past their five-block perimeter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.88,0:37:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.62,0:37:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 接下来怎么做 - 抓牢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, what's the next move? - Hang on tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.55,0:37:56.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这挺简单的嘛 我已经能控制它了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, this is easy! I'm getting the hang of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.49,0:37:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想往上飞就往上拉 就像骑马一样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yank up to go up. It's like a horse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.22,0:38:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你让247快要失去平衡了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're throwing 247 off balance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.12,0:38:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 他叫247\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait, his name is 247?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.89,0:38:03.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没有名字 只有编号 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't have a name, he has a number, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.79,0:38:06.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道一共有多少蚂蚁吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea how many ants there are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.10,0:38:08.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.10,0:38:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也有可能它是 可能它是248\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's... Maybe it's 248.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.83,0:38:11.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别 别 好晕 好晕\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no! Vertigo, vertigo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.60,0:38:12.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我认为它就是247\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I think it's 247.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.47,0:38:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.74,0:38:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抓紧点\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on tight!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.61,0:38:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我找到控制它的窍门了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm getting the hang of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.74,0:38:20.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我在控制247 它不听你的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am controlling 247. He is not listening to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.58,0:38:21.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.01,0:38:23.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我能提一点小小的要求吗 - 不能\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can I make one little request? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.08,0:38:26.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停下 247 先停一下 先停一下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop, 247! Time out, time out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.52,0:38:28.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,停一下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.79,0:38:29.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 抓紧了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, hold on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.95,0:38:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下 哦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wait! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.59,0:38:34.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我吐在头盔里怎么办\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happens if I throw up in this helmet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.59,0:38:37.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的头盔 斯科特 你不准吐\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's my helmet, Scott. You do not throw up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.76,0:38:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让她把我放下来 行吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's set her down, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.26,0:38:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经开始头晕了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting light-headed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.53,0:38:42.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.10,0:38:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的有点晕了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting a little light...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.13,0:38:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得小睡一会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a snooze button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.77,0:38:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后叫我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hit me in 5 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.53,0:39:08.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.20,0:39:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.73,0:39:18.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直站在这里 看着我睡觉吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you been standing there, watching me sleep, this whole time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.37,0:39:19.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.27,0:39:21.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.77,0:39:24.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你上次来的时候 偷走了一件东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because the last time you were here, you stole something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.71,0:39:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 哦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.31,0:39:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.58,0:39:30.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.02,0:39:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,学名 帕拉珀尼拉克拉瓦塔\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paraponera clavata.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.82,0:39:38.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是一种长得像子弹的巨型热带蚂蚁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Giant tropical bullet ants,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.59,0:39:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在施密特刺痛指数中位列第一\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ranked highest on the Schmidt pain index.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.22,0:39:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不在的时候它们会在这看着你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're here to keep an eye on you when I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.03,0:39:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮姆博士在楼下等你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Pym's waiting for you downstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.56,0:39:47.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.73,0:39:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.83,0:39:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃… 这是谁的睡裤？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Um... Whose pajamas are these?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.91,0:40:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这要怎么过去？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How am I supposed to do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.05,0:40:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 一步一步慢慢走\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, just one step at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.13,0:40:20.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们不咬我 我就不踩你们 好吧？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't bite me, I don't step on you. Deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.23,0:40:25.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以拆除服务器\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could take down the servers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.47,0:40:26.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,克罗斯不会发现的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Cross wouldn't even know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.80,0:40:28.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不需要这家伙\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.31,0:40:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你已经见过我女儿霍普了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assume that you've already met my daughter, Hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.64,0:40:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 她人很好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did. She's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.11,0:40:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她觉得我们不需要你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She doesn't think that we need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.61,0:40:37.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不需要 我们可以自己解决\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't. We can do this ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.08,0:40:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我费尽心思让你来偷我的战衣\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I go to all this effort to let you steal my suit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.15,0:40:42.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后霍普再让你被捕\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then Hope has you arrested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.02,0:40:45.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 我们可以让他试试 如果失败了 我就亲自出马\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we can try this and when he fails, I'll do it myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.92,0:40:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她有点焦虑\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a little bit anxious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.09,0:40:49.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和这次任务有关\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has to do with this job,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.79,0:40:52.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鉴于你已经坐在我对面了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which, judging by the fact that you're sitting opposite me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.20,0:40:54.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我猜你会对它感兴趣的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I take it that you're interested in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.77,0:40:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么任务？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What job?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.93,0:40:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想来点茶么？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like some tea?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.64,0:40:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.24,0:41:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我对你成功突破我的安保系统\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was very impressed with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.11,0:41:03.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,印象深刻\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how you managed to get past my security system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.14,0:41:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冰冻金属门那一招很聪明\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freezing that metal was particularly clever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.01,0:41:09.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在监视我？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you watching me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.71,0:41:12.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯科特 我已经监视你好一段时间了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scott, I've been watching you for a while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.02,0:41:15.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,从你抢劫维斯塔公司开始\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ever since you robbed Vista Corp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.69,0:41:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 抱歉\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh! Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.72,0:41:20.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,应该说"偷"\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Burgled" Vista Corp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.33,0:41:24.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,维斯塔的安保系统是业界\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vista's security system was one of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.19,0:41:26.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最先进的系统之一\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most advanced in the business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.16,0:41:27.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,本应固若金汤\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was supposed to be unbeatable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.97,0:41:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但还是被你成功突破了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you beat it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.97,0:41:31.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要加点糖吗？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you like some sugar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.37,0:41:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 谢谢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.04,0:41:38.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是不要了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.05,0:41:45.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么让它们做到的？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you make them do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.32,0:41:48.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蚂蚁可以举起它们体重五十倍的东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ants can lift objects 50 times their weight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.22,0:41:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们筑巢 翻土 它们之间相互配合\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They build, farm, they cooperate with each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.92,0:41:53.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 但你怎么让它们做到的？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. But how do you make them do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.06,0:42:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我用电磁波刺激它们的嗅觉神经中枢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I use electromagnetic waves to stimulate their olfactory nerve center.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.87,0:42:04.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和它们讲话\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I speak to them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.84,0:42:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我无所不在\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can go anywhere, hear anything,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.07,0:42:08.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,眼观六路 耳听八方\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and see everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.77,0:42:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但仍然一无所知\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And still know absolutely nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.04,0:42:12.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我见克罗斯要迟到了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm late to meet Cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.91,0:42:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃… 皮姆博士？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... Dr. Pym?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.95,0:42:20.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不用举手的 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't need to raise your hand, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.82,0:42:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉 我有个问题\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, I just have one question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.49,0:42:25.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁 她又是谁 这到底什么情况\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you, who is she, what the hell's going on,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.72,0:42:27.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有我现在可以回去坐牢了吗？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and can I go back to jail now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.32,0:42:29.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.36,0:42:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,四十年前 我发明了一个公式\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}40 years ago, I created a formula{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.46,0:42:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以改变原子之间的相对距离\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that altered atomic relative distance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.73,0:42:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.10,0:42:37.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在研究如何改变原子之间的距离\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I learned how to change the distance between atoms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.22,0:42:38.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也是这套战衣的威力所在\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what powers the suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.94,0:42:40.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是它工作的原理\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.84,0:42:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.21,0:42:49.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 哇 - 但是它很危险\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Whoa! - But it was dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.51,0:42:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,非常危险\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was too dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.98,0:42:56.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我只能将它隐匿于世\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I hid it from the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.02,0:42:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来我转而开办了自己的公司\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's when I switched gears and I started my own company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.52,0:43:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮姆科技\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pym Tech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.49,0:43:03.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.96,0:43:07.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我收了一个年轻学生叫达伦·克罗斯\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took on a young protege called Darren Cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.83,0:43:08.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达伦·克罗斯\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darren Cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.97,0:43:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可是个风云人物\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a big deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.43,0:43:13.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在他成为风云人物之前 还只是我的助手\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But before he was a big deal, he was my assistant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.04,0:43:17.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在他身上看到一些特质 我从没见过这样的孩子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I saw something in him. The son I never had, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.27,0:43:19.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他很聪明 但随着我们越来越亲近\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was brilliant, but as we became close,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.84,0:43:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他开始怀疑我对他有所隐瞒\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he began to suspect that I wasn't telling him everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.31,0:43:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他听到有关皮姆粒子的传言\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He heard rumors about what was called the Pym Particle,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.08,0:43:30.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,于是他沉迷于想复制我的公式\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he became obsessed with recreating my formula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.79,0:43:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我不愿意帮他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I wouldn't help him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.79,0:43:35.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以他密谋反对我 投票把我赶出了我的公司\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he conspired against me and he voted me out of my own company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.83,0:43:37.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么做到的？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could he do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.43,0:43:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,董事会主席是我的女儿 霍普\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The board's chairman is my daughter, Hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.10,0:43:41.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她投了决定票\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was the deciding vote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.80,0:43:45.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是当她看到克罗斯就要破解我的公式时\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she came back to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.47,0:43:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她又回到我身边\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when she saw how close Cross was to cracking my formula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.51,0:43:52.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他的研究过程很不稳定\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The process is highly volatile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.04,0:43:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有专业头盔的保护\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If one isn't protected by a specialized helmet,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.98,0:43:58.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将会影响大脑化学反应\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it can affect the brain's chemistry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.48,0:44:00.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得达伦还没意识到这一点\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think Darren realizes this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.98,0:44:04.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道 他原本就不是个稳重的人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, you know, he's not the most stable guy to begin with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.29,0:44:06.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以 你们想要我干什么？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you want from me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.93,0:44:12.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯科特 我相信每个人都应有自我救赎的机会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scott, I believe that everyone deserves a shot at redemption.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.30,0:44:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你信吗？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.36,0:44:14.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我信\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.50,0:44:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你可以帮我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you can help me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.23,0:44:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我保证 我可以让你和女儿重新团聚\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I promise I can help you be with your daughter again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.01,0:44:24.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 你准备好自我救赎了吗？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, are you ready to redeem yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.98,0:44:26.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.61,0:44:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我私闯民宅偷东西的日子 已经一去不复返了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My days of breaking into places and stealing shit are done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.95,0:44:32.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要我做什么？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want me to do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.55,0:44:35.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想让你私闯民宅偷东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to break into a place and steal some shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.59,0:44:40.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天晚上回家吃饭吗？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you gonna be home for dinner tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.72,0:44:42.29,Default,,0000,0000,0005,,(朗的"律师"是皮姆科技的汉克皮姆博士)
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.29,0:44:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我有点事 短信联系\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, yeah. I'll pick something up. Text me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.39,0:44:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 是好消息吗？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Good news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.26,0:44:48.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,呃… 我也不知道 只是个消息\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh... I don't know. It's news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.30,0:44:50.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在找我爸爸吗？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you trying to find my daddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.87,0:44:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 是的 小甜心\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I am, sweetheart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.72,0:44:57.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想你爸爸安然无恙\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want your daddy to be safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.52,0:44:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但愿你抓不到他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope you don't catch him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.56,0:45:47.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些人已经不是第一次\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't the first time these guys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.46,0:45:50.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要控制改变世界格局的新型武器了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have tried to get their hands on game-changing weaponry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.33,0:45:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是米切尔·卡森 神盾局前防卫部部长\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Mitchell Carson, Ex-Head of Defense at S.H.I.E.L.D.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.46,0:45:57.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在正致力于四处推翻政权\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Presently in the business of toppling governments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.20,0:45:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他一直觊觎我的技术\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He always wanted my tech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.34,0:46:02.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 除非我们溜进去偷出黄蜂战衣\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now, unless we break in and steal the Yellowjacket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.54,0:46:05.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摧毁所有的数据\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and destroy all the data,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.51,0:46:10.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,否则达伦·克罗斯会在全世界引发混乱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darren Cross is gonna unleash chaos upon the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.28,0:46:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得 我们首先应该通知复仇者联盟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think our first move should be calling the Avengers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.49,0:46:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我花费大半生精力\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent half my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.52,0:46:23.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不让这项技术落入斯塔克之手\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to keep this technology out of the hands of a Stark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.99,0:46:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在当然更不会把这项技术拱手让人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure as hell not gonna hand-deliver it to one now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.63,0:46:31.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这可不是钢铁侠盔甲那种花哨的技术\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not some cute technology like the Iron Man suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.07,0:46:33.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是可以改变现实结构的技术\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This could change the texture of reality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.57,0:46:37.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,况且 他们可能正忙着\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, they're probably too busy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.44,0:46:40.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把一座座城市从天上往下扔呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}dropping cities out of the sky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.24,0:46:41.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 那你为什么不直接派你的蚂蚁去？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, then why don't you just send the ants?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.65,0:46:45.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯科特 它们只是蚂蚁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scott, they are ants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.25,0:46:48.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蚂蚁虽然可以做很多事情 但它们需要一个领导者\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ants, they can do a lot of things, but they still need a leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.05,0:46:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个可以\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody that could infiltrate a place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.56,0:46:54.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无孔不入的人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's designed to prevent infiltration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.99,0:46:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉克 我只是一个小偷 好吗？我是说\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank, I'm a thief, all right? I mean,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.66,0:46:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管我是高明的小偷 但这也太疯狂了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a good thief, but this is insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.66,0:47:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说的没错 汉克 我想你也明白\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right, Hank. And you know it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.93,0:47:03.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经看了录像 知道克罗斯的神通本事了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've seen the footage, you know what Cross is capable of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.64,0:47:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,几个月前我就反对用他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was against using him when we had months,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.75,0:47:07.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而现在我们只剩几天了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now we have days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.67,0:47:08.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我来穿这套战衣\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm wearing the suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.68,0:47:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.29,0:47:12.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道里面所有机关 我也知道克罗斯的想法\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the facility inside and out. I know how Cross thinks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.01,0:47:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我比任何人都了解这项任务\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this mission better than anybody here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.82,0:47:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你紧跟在克罗斯身边 否则任务没法完成\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need you close to Cross. Otherwise, this mission cannot work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.45,0:47:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我们没有时间瞎折腾了 - 霍普 认真听我说…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We don't have time to screw around! - Hope, please listen to me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.15,0:47:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是一个罪犯 我可是你女儿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is a criminal! I'm your daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.55,0:47:22.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.29,0:48:03.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说得对 汉克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.13,0:48:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是最佳人选\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not your guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.40,0:48:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么不穿这套战服呢？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why don't you wear the suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.80,0:48:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我不想吗？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I don't want to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.10,0:48:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我不能穿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.20,0:48:14.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我穿了好几年\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I spent years wearing it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.44,0:48:17.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它对我的身体产生了副作用\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it took a toll on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.25,0:48:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是我们唯一的希望\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're our only option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.86,0:48:35.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在霍普失去母亲之前\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before Hope lost her mother,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.16,0:48:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她看我就像 我是全世界最了不起的人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she used to look at me like I was the greatest man in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.76,0:48:43.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在她看着我眼神只剩下失望\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now she looks at me and there's just disappointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.40,0:48:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说太迟了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late for me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.41,0:48:52.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不一样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.24,0:48:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的机会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.44,0:48:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能赢得你女儿崇拜目光的机会\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The chance to earn that look in your daughter's eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.15,0:49:02.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,成为她心目中的英雄\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To become the hero that she already thinks you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.75,0:49:04.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是在拯救我们的世界\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not about saving our world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.12,0:49:08.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而是她们的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about saving theirs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.70,0:49:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,该死 真是好一通说教\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn. That was a good speech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.13,0:49:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scott,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.47,0:49:20.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你成为蚁人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to be the Ant-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.41,0:49:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最佳状态是\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the right hands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.18,0:49:28.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,人与衣服合二为一\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the relationship between man and suit is symbiotic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.15,0:49:31.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战服拥有力量 人驾驭这种力量\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The suit has power. The man harnesses that power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.78,0:49:34.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要熟练使用 快速敏捷 最重要的是\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to be skillful, agile, and above all,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.68,0:49:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定要快\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you need to be fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.19,0:49:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要瞬间\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be able to shrink and grow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.19,0:49:39.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,缩小和变大\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on a dime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.79,0:49:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,根据需求缩放自如\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So your size always suits your needs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.33,0:49:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在 穿过这个钥匙孔 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now dive through the keyhole, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.30,0:49:49.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正常体型加速 穿越时要变小 穿过后再变大\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You charge big, you dive small, then you emerge big.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.18,0:49:59.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真是没用\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Useless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.32,0:50:02.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你变小时 能量会压缩\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you're small, energy's compressed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.95,0:50:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以百分之一寸大小的拳头\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you have the force of a 200-pound man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.05,0:50:08.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,约含有九十公斤的人的力量 你就像一颗子弹\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}behind a fist a 100th of an inch wide. You're like a bullet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.22,0:50:11.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,出拳太狠就会杀掉别人 太轻了就像是爱抚\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You punch too hard, you kill someone. Too soft, it's a love tap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.62,0:50:13.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,话句话说 你应该要知道要怎么出拳\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In other words, you have to know how to punch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.42,0:50:15.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在监狱待了三年 我知道怎么出拳\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in prison for three years. I know how to punch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.36,0:50:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我瞧瞧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.96,0:50:18.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 真差劲 - 你想教我怎么出拳？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Terrible. - You wanna show me how to punch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.30,0:50:20.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我瞧瞧…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.73,0:50:23.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这才叫出拳\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how you punch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.77,0:50:25.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她等这一刻很久了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's been looking forward to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.20,0:50:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没开玩笑\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No kidding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.63,0:50:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍普在一段困难时期练过武术\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope trained in martial arts at a difficult time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.24,0:50:31.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,噢 所谓"困难时期"就是我母亲去世的时候\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, by "difficult time," he means when my mother died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.47,0:50:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她死于空难\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost her in a plane crash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.48,0:50:35.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不肯告诉我她怎么死的就算了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bad enough you won't tell me how she died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.33,0:50:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能不能别再跟我撒谎？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you please stop telling me that lie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.12,0:50:38.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在训练呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're working, here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.82,0:50:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 小公主 我们继续\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, princess. Let's get back to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.49,0:50:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你的手吗？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you going for the hand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.12,0:50:55.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这个调节器有点碍事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I think this regulator is holding me back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.27,0:50:57.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要动调节器\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not screw with the regulator.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.83,0:50:59.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果调节器被破坏\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that regulator is compromised,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.67,0:51:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会变成亚原子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you would go subatomic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.47,0:51:03.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.94,0:51:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意味着你会进入量子域\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means that you would enter a quantum realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.01,0:51:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这又是什么意思\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.71,0:51:09.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,意味着你会永久缩小\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means that you would enter a reality{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.85,0:51:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会进入到一个时间和空间\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where all concepts of time and space{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.28,0:51:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,都没有概念\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}become irrelevant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.42,0:51:15.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的现实世界\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you shrink for all eternity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.79,0:51:19.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你所知的和爱的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything that you know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.46,0:51:20.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and love,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.66,0:51:23.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将会永远消失\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gone forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.39,0:51:27.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,酷 如果它没坏就算了…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cool. Yeah, if it ain't broke...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.56,0:51:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经了解了战服\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've learned about the suit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.03,0:51:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你还需要了解你了不起的盟友\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you've yet to learn about your greatest allies,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.04,0:51:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蚂蚁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the ants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.40,0:51:36.19,Default,,0000,0000,0005,,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.64,0:51:36.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,忠诚 勇敢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Loyal, brave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.04,0:51:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你这次任务的搭档\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and your partners on this job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.28,0:51:47.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,长角立毛蚁 通常被称为狂蚁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paratrechina longicornis. Commonly known as crazy ants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.05,0:51:49.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们具有闪电般的速度并且能导电\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're lightning fast and can conduct electricity,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.42,0:51:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可用于攻击敌人的电子系统\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which makes them useful to fry out enemy electronics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.66,0:51:53.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你没那么疯狂嘛\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not so crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.76,0:51:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.83,0:51:56.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真可爱\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're cute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.80,0:52:08.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一秒钟前太可怕了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a lot scarier a second ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.85,0:52:21.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看起来未来实验室有一套独立的供电系统\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks like the Futures Lab has its own isolated power supply.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.05,0:52:22.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且全天候都有警卫执勤\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a security guard posted around the clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.99,0:52:25.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要你打晕他 然后解除安保系统\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll need you to take him out to deactivate the security systems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.82,0:52:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的 接下来是谁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, who's next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.27,0:52:31.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,帕拉珀尼拉克拉瓦塔\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Paraponera clavata.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.88,0:52:33.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道 子弹蚁 对吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. Bullet ants, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.46,0:52:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在施密特刺痛指数中位列第一\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Number 1 on the Schmidt pain index?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.93,0:52:36.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计们 还记得我吗 卧室里见过\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, guys. Remember me from the bedroom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.74,0:52:41.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,黄色战衣被密封在保险库里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Yellowjacket pod is hermetically sealed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.74,0:52:43.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,接近它的唯一途径是一根管子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the only access point is a tube{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.41,0:52:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们估计它的直径大约是五毫米\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we estimate to be about 5 millimeters in diameter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.98,0:52:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我感觉胃里一直犯恶心\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do I have a sick feeling in my stomach?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.89,0:52:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,管子被激光网保护\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tube is protected by a laser grid,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.92,0:52:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我们只能断电十五秒\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we can only power that down for 15 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.92,0:52:54.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你需要在备用电源恢复前指挥\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna need to signal the crazy ants to blow the servers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.48,0:52:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狂蚁破坏服务器 拿到战服\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}retrieve the suit, and exit the vaults{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.72,0:52:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,离开保险库\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before the backup power comes on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.86,0:53:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宾夕法尼亚弓背蚁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Camponotus pennsylvanicus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.73,0:53:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,俗称木工蚁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alternatively known as a carpenter ant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.36,0:53:06.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,适合于地面和航空运输\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ideal for ground and air transport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.03,0:53:07.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 我认识它\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute, I know this guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.00,0:53:11.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我打算叫它"安东蚁"\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna call him "Ant-thony."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.57,0:53:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 非常好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good. That's very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.90,0:53:15.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为这次 你真要好好学学\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because this time, you're really gonna{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.11,0:53:17.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如何控制它\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have to learn how to control him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.61,0:53:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让它们把糖放进茶杯中\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them to put the sugar in the teacup.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.08,0:53:24.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你还好吗 我伤到…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw! You okay? Did I hurt...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.43,0:53:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉克让你到外面进行针对训练\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank wants you outside for target practice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.56,0:53:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战服没有武器 所以我给你做了这些飞镖\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The suit has no weapons, so I made you these discs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.83,0:53:41.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,红色用来缩小\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red shrinks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.10,0:53:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,蓝色用来放大\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blue enlarges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.77,0:53:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火蚁属\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Solenopsis mandibularis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.44,0:53:51.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以它的叮咬闻名\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Known for their bite,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.61,0:53:54.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,火蚁已经进化成为了出色的建筑师\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the fire ants have evolved into remarkable architects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.11,0:53:56.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能辅助你进出各种困难的地方\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are handy to get you in and out of difficult places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.09,0:54:07.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能做到的 斯科特 加油\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can do it, Scott. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.69,0:54:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它们不听我的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not listening to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.83,0:54:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须投入 精准传达你的意思\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to commit. You have to mean it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.60,0:54:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有捷径 不能欺骗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No shortcuts, no lies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.67,0:54:19.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说话带刺\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throwing insults into the mix{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.87,0:54:22.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对任何人都没有好处 霍普\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will not do anyone any good, Hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.21,0:54:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有时间宠着他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have time for coddling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.97,0:54:26.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的焦点应该是帮助斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our focus should be on helping Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.04,0:54:27.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.78,0:54:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们应该聚焦的吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that where our focus should be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.50,0:54:55.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍普\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.65,0:55:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂为什么一开始会来找你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know why I came to you in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.99,0:55:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能没有她\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't do this without her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.27,0:55:23.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 上帝啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.83,0:55:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该把车门锁上\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta lock your doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.87,0:55:28.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说 真的 这附近有很多奇怪的人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, really, there's some weird folks in this neighborhood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.84,0:55:31.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为这是闹着玩吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think this is a joke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.54,0:55:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有想过 他让你冒多大的险\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea what he's asking you to risk?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.94,0:55:35.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有一个女儿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.25,0:55:37.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我做这些就是为了她\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm doing this for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.21,0:55:39.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 当我妈妈过世时 我两周都没有见到他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, when my mother died, I didn't see him for two weeks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.58,0:55:41.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在悲痛之中\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was in grief.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.75,0:55:43.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 我也是 我当时只有七岁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, so was I, and I was seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.29,0:55:46.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他从没回来过 从没真正回来过\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he never came back. Not in any way that counted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.62,0:55:48.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他只是把我送去了寄宿学校\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just sent me off to boarding school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.79,0:55:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I thought,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.63,0:55:53.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在这种危机关头\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with all that's at stake,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.13,0:55:56.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我们能有机会重归于好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just maybe we might have a chance of making peace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.13,0:55:58.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但即便是现在 他内心还是在排斥我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, even now, he still wants to shut me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.13,0:56:01.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他没有排斥你 他信任你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't wanna shut you out. He trusts you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.07,0:56:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那他为什么会找你来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why are you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.74,0:56:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这证明他爱你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It proves that he loves you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.91,0:56:08.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍普 看着我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope. Look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.71,0:56:11.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以是牺牲品\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm expendable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.75,0:56:13.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我来这里的原因\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.58,0:56:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你现在应该明白\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must have realized that by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.29,0:56:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是我穿着战服 而不是你穿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, it's why I'm in the suit and you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.59,0:56:23.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他宁愿输了这场战斗也不愿失去你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would rather lose this fight than lose you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.63,0:56:26.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的…\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.03,0:56:31.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗 我当时报警的时候\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I didn't know you had a daughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.07,0:56:33.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真不知道你有个女儿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I called the cops on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.31,0:56:38.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她叫什么名字\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's her name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.31,0:56:40.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,凯茜\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cassie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.78,0:56:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好美的名字\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a pretty name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.62,0:56:48.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须清除杂念 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to clear your mind, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.15,0:56:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须让你的思路精准\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to make your thoughts precise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.85,0:56:51.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样才行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's how it works.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.76,0:56:54.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想着凯茜\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think about Cassie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.66,0:56:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想着你有多想见她 利用这个来集中注意力\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About how badly you want to see her. And use that to focus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.90,0:57:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,睁开眼睛\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open your eyes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.97,0:57:11.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,专心思考你想让蚂蚁们做什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and just think about what you want the ants to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.96,0:57:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.12,0:57:56.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你妈妈当时说服了我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother convinced me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.09,0:57:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让她加入了我的任务\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to let her join me on my missions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.86,0:58:01.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们叫她黄蜂女\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They called her the Wasp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.92,0:58:04.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她对这个很有天分\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was born to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.00,0:58:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有一天不在后悔\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's not a day that goes by{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.83,0:58:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我后悔当初答应了她\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I don't regret having said yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.07,0:58:18.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一九八七年\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was 1987.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.78,0:58:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,分裂主义者劫持了苏联位于库尔斯克的导弹发射井\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Separatists had hijacked a Soviet missile silo in Kursk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.78,0:58:27.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,向美国发射了一枚洲际弹道导弹\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and launched an ICBM at the United States.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.19,0:58:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唯一能进入导弹内部结构的方法\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only way to the internal mechanics{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.23,0:58:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是穿过钛固体\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was through solid titanium.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.87,0:58:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我必须缩小到分子状态穿进去 才能拆除导弹\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew I had to shrink between the molecules to disarm the missile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.44,0:58:57.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我的调节器已经遭受了太多损坏\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But my regulator had sustained too much damage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.22,0:59:00.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的母亲\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.92,0:59:02.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她没有犹豫\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she didn't hesitate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.25,0:59:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,珍妮特 不要\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janet! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.80,0:59:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她关掉了她的调节器\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She turned off her regulator{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.87,0:59:17.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,变成了亚原子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and went subatomic{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.07,0:59:21.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去拆除导弹\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to deactivate the bomb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.01,0:59:24.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后她就走了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.21,0:59:31.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的妈妈死得很英勇\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mom died a hero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.22,0:59:36.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那以后的十年间我一直\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I spent the next 10 years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.45,0:59:40.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽我所能的去研究量子领域\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to learn all I could about the quantum realm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.33,0:59:46.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是想带她回来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were trying to bring her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.30,0:59:51.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我研究到 我们对此还是一无所知\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But all I learned was we know nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.87,0:59:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你的错\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.91,1:00:02.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她自己做的决定\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She made her choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.05,1:00:11.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你为什么没早点告诉我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But why didn't you tell me that sooner?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.82,1:00:14.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是想保护你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was trying to protect you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.43,1:00:18.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经失去了你的母亲\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost your mother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.26,1:00:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不想再失去你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't mean to lose you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.57,1:00:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.54,1:00:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.04,1:00:32.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这太棒了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's awesome, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.01,1:00:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩在解除心防 伤口在愈合\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are breaking down walls, you're healing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.98,1:00:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这很重要\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.15,1:00:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我破坏了气氛 对吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I ruined the moment, didn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.88,1:00:43.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 是的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you did. Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.55,1:00:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我去泡杯茶\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to make some tea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.13,1:00:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞定\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nailed it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.47,1:01:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好孩子 安东蚁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a good boy, Ant-thony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.40,1:01:37.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,训练的最后一阶段是秘密入侵\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The final phase of your training will be a stealth incursion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.34,1:01:38.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,冻死了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's freezing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.91,1:01:41.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你就不能做一件法兰绒的战服吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You couldn't make a suit with a flannel lining?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.92,1:01:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须取回这个信号伪装的原型机\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must retrieve this prototype of a signal decoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.93,1:01:47.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个装置是我在神盾局时发明的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a device that I invented during my S.H.I.E.L.D. days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.34,1:01:49.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要用它来对付克罗斯在未来实验室保险库里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need it to counteract the transmission blockers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.35,1:01:51.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安装的传输阻滞器\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Cross installed in the Futures vault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.52,1:01:54.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,它正在纽约州最北部\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's currently collecting dust{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.59,1:01:57.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍华德·斯塔克的一处旧仓库里吃灰呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in one of Howard Stark's old storage facilities in upstate New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.33,1:01:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拿到手应该是小菜一碟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should be a piece of cake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.36,1:02:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在目标区域上空了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're over the target area.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.33,1:02:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在出发 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disengage now, Scott!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.90,1:02:04.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A中队 出发\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Squadron A, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.93,1:02:06.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,B中队 出发\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}B, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.60,1:02:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C中队 出发\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}C, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.91,1:02:14.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 安东蚁 拜托这次别又让我掉下去了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Ant-thony, please don't drop me this time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.28,1:02:17.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感觉从运糖块到这个跨度太大啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, it feels like a big leap from sugar cubes to this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.51,1:02:18.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,保持冷静\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay calm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.38,1:02:22.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,各位 我们可能有麻烦了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys? We might have a problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.55,1:02:26.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉克 你不是说这是一个旧仓库吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank, didn't you say this was some old warehouse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.06,1:02:27.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这并不是\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.32,1:02:30.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你个混蛋\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You son of a bitch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.56,1:02:34.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 斯科特 撤退 - 任务中止\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Scott, get out of there. - Abort!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.46,1:02:36.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在中止\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abort now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.20,1:02:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 没事 看起来没人在家\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's okay. It doesn't look like anyone's home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.43,1:02:40.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安东蚁 带我去楼顶\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ant-thony, get me to the roof!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.37,1:02:42.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会丢了这套战服的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna lose the suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.54,1:02:44.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会丢了性命的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna lose his life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.11,1:02:52.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了 我在目标大楼的楼顶了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I'm on the roof of the target building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.22,1:02:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人回家了 斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody's home, Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.95,1:02:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下面什么情况 山姆\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on down there, Sam?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.36,1:03:01.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是猎鹰\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the Falcon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.26,1:03:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,感应器有反应 但我没看见什么东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a sensor trip but I'm not seeing anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.96,1:03:04.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.03,1:03:07.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,中止 斯科特 现在中止\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Abort, Scott! Abort now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:07.10,1:03:08.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没事 他看不见我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. He can't see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.50,1:03:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能看见你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.63,1:03:10.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他能看见我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.14,1:03:15.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我是斯科特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi. I'm Scott.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.34,1:03:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他刚才说:"嗨 我是斯科特"吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he just say, "Hi, I'm Scott"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.04,1:03:18.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来这里干什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.57,1:03:20.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,首先 我是你的超级粉丝\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First off, I'm a big fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.44,1:03:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很感激 那么 你到底是谁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Appreciate it. So, who the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.68,1:03:23.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是蚁人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Ant-Man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.75,1:03:25.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"蚁人"？\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Ant-Man"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.28,1:03:27.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了 你没听说过我吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You haven't heard of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.45,1:03:29.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你不会听说过我的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you wouldn't have heard of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.62,1:03:31.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想告诉我你要什么吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna tell me what you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.35,1:03:33.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要一件高科技装置\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping I could grab a piece of technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.66,1:03:35.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,借用几天 我会还回来的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just for a few days. I'm gonna return it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.66,1:03:38.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要用它拯救世界 你懂的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need it to save the world. You know how that is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.36,1:03:39.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 我太懂了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know exactly how that is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.50,1:03:41.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,找到闯入者了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Located the breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.70,1:03:43.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 正在抓他 - 对不起了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bringing him in. - Sorry about this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.60,1:03:49.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在干什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.24,1:03:53.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,闯入者是一个成年男性\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breach is an adult male,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.61,1:03:55.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一种缩身术\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who has some sort of shrinking tech.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.16,1:04:09.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.43,1:04:10.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的对不起了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm sorry about this. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.49,1:04:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,玩够了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.55,1:04:37.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,安东蚁 帮我一把\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ant-thony! A little help!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.07,1:04:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我看不到你了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've lost visual.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.24,1:05:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在我背包里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's inside my pack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.58,1:05:02.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.41,1:05:05.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好像很了不起\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem like a really great guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.77,1:05:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,千万别让美国队长发现这事 这对我很重要\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really important to me that Cap never finds out about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.85,1:05:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事完全是不负责任 还很危险\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was completely irresponsible and dangerous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.85,1:05:44.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你把所有的事都搞砸了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You jeopardized everything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.24,1:06:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你拿到了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.64,1:06:05.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.71,1:06:06.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.78,1:06:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你刚刚是在夸我吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just compliment me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.28,1:06:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在夸我 没错吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did, didn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.55,1:06:11.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听起来好像是\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of sounded like he did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.78,1:06:14.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以前也很棒 不是吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was good, wasn't I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.22,1:06:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 我单挑一个复仇者还活着回来了 怎么样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, how about the fact that I fought an Avenger and didn't die?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.52,1:06:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们别沉醉于过去里了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us not dwell on the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.89,1:06:23.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得完成计划\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gotta finish our planning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.36,1:06:27.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别理他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mind him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.56,1:06:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你干得漂亮\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.47,1:06:37.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达伦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darren.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.71,1:06:42.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么进来的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How the hell did you get in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.58,1:06:46.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉克 你前门没锁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You left the front door open, Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.25,1:06:47.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说真的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's official.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.32,1:06:48.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你老了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.22,1:06:50.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,计划图纸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The plans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.55,1:06:53.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达伦会杀了他的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will kill him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.59,1:06:58.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大驾光临 有何指教\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, to what do I owe this pleasure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.33,1:07:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我有好消息\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.70,1:07:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.77,1:07:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么好消息\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.57,1:07:10.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,皮姆科技 也就是你创建的公司\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pym Tech, the company you created,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.27,1:07:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即将成为这世界上\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is about to become one of the most{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.27,1:07:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最赚钱的公司之一\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}profitable operations in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.38,1:07:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,仅仅明天一天的销售额 预计可以达到一百五十亿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're anticipating $15 billion in sales, tomorrow alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.35,1:07:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不用谢我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.99,1:07:32.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这有点怪 但是我希望你在现场\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this is odd, but I'd like you to be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.00,1:07:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,由你来见证属于我的时刻\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my moment. I want you to see it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.43,1:07:37.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 达伦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sure, Darren. Yeah, sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.87,1:07:39.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会去的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.42,1:07:57.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在我身上看到了什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you see in me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.82,1:08:01.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂你的意思\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.39,1:08:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多年前 你选择了我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All those years ago, you picked me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.83,1:08:05.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看上我什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you see?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.50,1:08:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.90,1:08:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你为什么又放弃我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why did you push me away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.84,1:08:17.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我发现我们俩太像了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I saw too much of myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.02,1:08:29.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他知道了 他在给你布局\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows. He's baiting you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.55,1:08:31.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得取消计划\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to call it off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.52,1:08:32.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得冒这个险\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all taking risks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.59,1:08:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他看见我在这怎么办\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if he saw me here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.96,1:08:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不可能 他不可能看见你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't. There's no way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.59,1:08:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.40,1:08:46.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达伦 你好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darren, hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.60,1:08:49.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,霍普 你现在在哪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hope, where are you right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.07,1:08:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在家 怎么了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm at home. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.34,1:08:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚见过汉克了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saw Hank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.38,1:08:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从他那得到的只有鄙视 其他的一无所获\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still get nothing but contempt from him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.48,1:08:58.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,犯不着为了他动肝火 他就是个糟老头\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let him rile you up. He's just a senile old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.88,1:09:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要让所有人全天侯干活\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to start everyone working around the clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.45,1:09:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让流水线设备投入运行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get the assembly line up and running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.35,1:09:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还要加强三倍安保\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm tripling security.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.69,1:09:06.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有入口处都安装感应器\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full sensors at all entrances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.79,1:09:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所有外围通风口都要安装微型钢制网罩\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and exterior air vents fitted with steel micro-mesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.09,1:09:12.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好 好主意\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great. Good idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.73,1:09:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 霍普 我很幸运有你在我的团队\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Hope. I'm so lucky to have you on my team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.73,1:09:23.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他加强了三倍安保 他疯了 他盯上你了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's tripling security. He's lost his mind, and he's onto you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.11,1:09:25.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但他没有盯上你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he is not onto you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.34,1:09:27.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在所有入口都加装全身扫描\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's adding full body scanners to all entrances{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.58,1:09:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有封锁外围通风口\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and closing exterior vents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.61,1:09:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们怎么才能把斯科特弄进去\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we gonna get Scott inside?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.85,1:09:34.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总水管\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The water main.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.68,1:09:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能在总水管设安保\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't add security to a water main.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.69,1:09:39.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,水压太大 但如果我们能减压\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pressure is too strong, but if we can decrease it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.89,1:09:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就能进去\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's how I get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.29,1:09:43.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样就得有人去大楼控制中心\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody would have to reach the building's control center{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.72,1:09:44.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,调节水压\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to change the water pressure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.93,1:09:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,汉克和我在那个时候会在克洛斯身旁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hank and I will be beside Cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.53,1:09:47.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我们该怎么去做这事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are we supposed to do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.80,1:09:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得扩大我们的队伍\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we expand our team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.83,1:09:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we need?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.10,1:09:52.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个人伪装成保安进入大楼内部\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fake security guard on the inside{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.87,1:09:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,由他来调节水压\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to de-pressurize the water system,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.57,1:09:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,另一个黑进电源供应系统\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somebody else to hack in to the power supply{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.47,1:09:57.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,关闭激光网\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and kill the laser grid,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.81,1:10:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还有一个人负责接应\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a getaway guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.48,1:10:04.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不 不行 不要那三个草包 绝对不行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no. No, no, no. Not those three wombats. No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.95,1:10:06.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你的咖啡 女士\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for the coffee, ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.98,1:10:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事确实少见 很少有人偷完东西 还被盛情款待的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not too often that you rob a place and then get welcomed back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.99,1:10:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟我们刚来偷过东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because we just robbed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.92,1:10:17.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道他是因为偷了一个冰沙机被抓的 是吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that he was arrested for stealing a smoothie machine, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.06,1:10:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是两个冰沙机\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two smoothie machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.63,1:10:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你确定他们能行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure they can handle this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.10,1:10:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能搞定 我们很专业\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, we can handle it. We're professionals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.90,1:10:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原谅我们对你们实在没有什么信心\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll forgive us if we're not instilled with confidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.62,1:10:28.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿 伙计 大家都应该静下心来放松点\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, hey, everybody just kick back and relax a little bit, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.25,1:10:29.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的业务能力很高超\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We know our business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.76,1:10:32.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这么坚固的鬼房子我们都钻进来了 你说是不是\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We broke into this spooky-ass house, didn't we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.07,1:10:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我放你进来的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I let you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.58,1:10:36.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还说 是我让你放我进来呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, one could say that I let you let me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.92,1:10:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题 他们能搞定\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it's okay. They can handle this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.03,1:10:40.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我们能行\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we can handle it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.34,1:10:42.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你能给他证件吗 - 他在公司系统里了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got their credentials? - He's in the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.45,1:10:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在系统里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in the system?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.59,1:10:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在系统里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're in the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.85,1:10:45.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,系统\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The system?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.09,1:10:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们死定了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we're doomed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.39,1:10:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.62,1:10:51.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们得看看这个\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something you guys need to see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.26,1:10:53.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到了这个转角\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you get to this corner,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.16,1:10:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的左边会有三间办公室\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's gonna be three offices on your left side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.00,1:10:57.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我靠\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.80,1:11:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇喔 真是酷毙了 兄弟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa! That's so cool, bro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.80,1:11:04.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着 接下来可能有点诡异\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, look, this is gonna get weird, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.57,1:11:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怪吓人的 不过没危险\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pretty freaky, but it's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.05,1:11:07.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有理由会害怕\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no reason to be scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.86,1:11:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不不 老子才不怕\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, no. Daddy don't get scared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.31,1:11:11.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 是吗 - 当然\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.02,1:11:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.42,1:11:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是吉普赛人的鬼把戏\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the work of gypsies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.52,1:11:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是巫术\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's witchcraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.76,1:11:24.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇 真神奇\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, that's amazing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.52,1:11:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就像大卫·科波菲尔的魔术\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's like some David Copperfield shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.13,1:11:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像是魔法\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's some kind of wizardry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.33,1:11:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是巫术\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is sorcery!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.43,1:11:29.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么做到的 兄弟\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you do that, bro?{\r}
