Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.24,1:19:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 不\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.01,1:20:01.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.42,1:20:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,列队\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assume formation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.28,1:20:11.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 你们这些可爱的小疯子\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, you cute little crazies,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.25,1:20:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,烧毁服务器吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's fry these servers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.20,1:20:27.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们上 伙计\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go get 'em, buddy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.61,1:20:40.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,服务器烧毁了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Servers are fried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.68,1:20:43.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,数据备份也彻底被抹掉了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Data backup completely erased.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.18,1:20:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正在赶往粒子室\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heading to the particle chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.13,1:20:52.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好 克罗斯博士\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Dr. Cross.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.10,1:20:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的合伙人已经同意你的条款了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My associates have agreed to your terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.37,1:21:01.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好极了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wonderful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.10,1:21:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,卡森先生把我介绍给了这几位先生\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Carson introduced me to these fine gentlemen here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.74,1:21:05.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是九头蛇的代表\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're representatives of Hydra.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.41,1:21:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们已经改头换面了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're not what they were.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.64,1:21:09.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们现在做些很有趣的工作\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're doing some interesting work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.18,1:21:12.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我也很享受这种乐趣\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm enjoying myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.38,1:21:14.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一直试图向我隐瞒你的研究成果\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tried to hide your technology from me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.62,1:21:16.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可现在它即将在你面前大放异彩\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now it's gonna blow up in your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.22,1:21:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦 我早就猜到你会打我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow! I mean, I saw that punch coming a mile away,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.23,1:21:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我还以为会是软绵绵的一拳\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I just figured it'd be all pathetic and weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.20,1:21:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就猜错了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you figured wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.70,1:21:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我认得这辆车\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know this van.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.44,1:21:34.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody home?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.48,1:21:41.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了伙计们 我到了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, guys. I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.25,1:21:47.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正在安装炸弹\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm setting the charges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.53,1:22:09.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮 伙计们 接下来就交给我吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great job, guys. I'll take it from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.88,1:22:21.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好样的 安东蚁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good boy, Ant-thony.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.42,1:22:23.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到达最终目的地了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Final position.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.26,1:22:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们 你们还没有搞定激光网吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, how we looking on that laser grid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.63,1:22:36.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就快了 - 你还差得远呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Almost. - No, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.26,1:22:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 马上就好了 - 才没有\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm getting close! - No, you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.34,1:22:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旧金山警察局\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}San Francisco P.D.!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.91,1:22:44.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快从车子里出来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the van!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.51,1:22:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你们就在里面\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you're in there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.57,1:22:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再快点\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it go faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.71,1:22:48.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,伙计 别催我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.45,1:22:56.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,准备跳了 你那边弄好了吗 库尔特\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready to jump. Do you read, Kurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.62,1:22:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就快好了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.49,1:23:00.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 举起手来 - 等等 - 别动\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, hold up! - Wait a minute! - Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.12,1:23:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚有一个和我长得很像的黑人袭击了我们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was a black guy that looked exactly like me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.05,1:23:03.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他把我们塞进了这辆令人作呕的车里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who attacked us and put us in the back of this disgusting van.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.83,1:23:05.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 给我出来 - 好好 我这就出来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out of the van! - Okay, I'm coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.26,1:23:07.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你慢点啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.23,1:23:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我现在还不能离开 快跳\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I will not move! Go now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.17,1:23:12.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.43,1:23:13.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 你说的等等是什么意思\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What do you mean, "Wait"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.75,1:23:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么 怎么了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.45,1:23:27.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你好呀 小家伙\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, little guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.60,1:23:43.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直怀疑你在某个地方藏了一套战服\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always suspected you had a suit stored away somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.60,1:23:44.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那问题就来了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which begs the question,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.67,1:23:46.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是那个新的蚁人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who is the new Ant-Man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.90,1:23:49.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谁是那个比我更受\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is the man that my beloved mentor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.40,1:23:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我敬爱导师信任的人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trusted even more than me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.54,1:23:55.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯科特·朗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scott Lang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.25,1:23:58.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个勇士\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A martyr{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.91,1:24:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个因为攻破公司的系统而失去了家庭\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who took on the system and paid the price,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.45,1:24:04.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失去了女儿并拥有献身精神的人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}losing his family and his only daughter in the process.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.92,1:24:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这正是你的最佳人选 汉克\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly your kind of guy, Hank!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.39,1:24:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他逃出了拘留所 没有留下任何线索\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He escapes his jail cell without leaving any clue as to how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.70,1:24:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后神奇般的消失了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then he disappears magically,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.53,1:24:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,尽管他名下穷得一分钱都没有\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}despite having no money to his name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.74,1:24:24.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可现在 他却给我带来了蚁人战服\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now he brings me the Ant-Man suit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.77,1:24:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也只有这件东西能与我的发明抗衡\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only thing that can rival my creation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.41,1:24:33.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达伦 别这样\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darren, don't do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.92,1:24:36.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你把它卖给了这些人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you sell to these men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.25,1:24:37.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将会掀起一场腥风血雨\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's gonna be chaos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.59,1:24:39.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经卖了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.25,1:24:40.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还是以两倍的价格\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for twice the price,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.59,1:24:42.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这得感谢你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}thanks to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.89,1:24:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要潜进复仇者联盟的基地可不是件容易的事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not easy to successfully infiltrate an Avengers facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.33,1:24:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,幸运的是 消息传播得很快\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thankfully, word travels fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.40,1:24:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会把黄蜂战衣卖给他们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll sell them the Yellowjacket,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.37,1:24:51.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过粒子能源我自己留着\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I'm keeping the particle to myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.27,1:24:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,战衣不是靠柴油的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't run on diesel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.74,1:24:57.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,想要补充能源 你还是得来找我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want the fuel, you'll have to come to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.57,1:25:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会怎么称呼那个\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you call the only man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.64,1:25:04.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界上拥有最厉害的武器的人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who can arm the most powerful weapon in the world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.28,1:25:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,世界的统治者\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The most powerful man in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.78,1:25:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在你为我感到骄傲了吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You proud of me yet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.58,1:25:11.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达伦 现在停手还为时不晚\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can stop this, Darren. It's not too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.69,1:25:14.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,无法挽回了 这已成定局\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been too late for a long time now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.36,1:25:17.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,达伦\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Darren!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.56,1:25:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你在做什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.07,1:25:23.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他对你还没我对你好\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wasn't any more capable of caring for you than he was for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.80,1:25:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是真正的你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.83,1:25:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些粒子改变了你的头脑\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the particles altering your brain chemistry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.81,1:25:38.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 等等 等一下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait, wait, wait, wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.78,1:25:43.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是对的 我应该亲自动手\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. I have to be the one to do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.85,1:25:46.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.52,1:25:51.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放下你的枪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop your gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.53,1:25:57.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天晚上我去他家里 本来是要杀了他\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I came to the house the other night to kill him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.57,1:25:59.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你在那里\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you were there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.37,1:26:02.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你失去理智了 我可以帮你 把枪放下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're sick and I can help you. Just put the gun down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.34,1:26:03.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我那时并不想杀你的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wasn't ready to kill you then,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.37,1:26:06.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我愿意了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I think I am now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.47,1:26:08.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快把枪放下\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop your gun now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.84,1:26:11.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你站错了队伍了 霍普\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You picked the wrong side, Hope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.09,1:26:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!{\r}
