Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.12,1:44:46.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,斯科特 我今天跟我队长见了一面\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scott, I met with my captain today.{\r}
