Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.14,1:44:57.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我告诉他你完全是走正当程序出狱的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I told him that you were processed correctly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.47,1:44:58.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.67,1:44:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.48,1:45:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,总不能因为一点技术上的小故障 就把凯茜的爸爸又送回监狱 对吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't be sending Cassie's dad back to jail on a technical glitch, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.68,1:45:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你 帕克斯顿\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Paxton.{\r}
