Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.08,1:45:10.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你为凯茜做的一切\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for everything you do for Cassie.{\r}
