Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.12,1:45:17.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 这一回 我是为了你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, no. This one, I did for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.49,1:45:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有点尴尬 - 是啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This is awkward. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:20.99,1:45:21.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:22.22,1:45:24.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在想 经历了这些事之后 我们该说点什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, what do we even talk about after all of that?{\r}
