Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.84,1:45:27.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我今天翻了人生中第一个跟斗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did my first cartwheel today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:27.04,1:45:28.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.50,1:45:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 她练习翻跟斗都已经一个星期了呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. She has been practicing all week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:30.97,1:45:32.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但今天终于到了见证奇迹的时刻\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But today was the magic day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.67,1:45:33.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我拿手机录下来了 看\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I recorded it on my phone. Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:35.58,1:45:37.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不 这不可能是凯茜 这才不是你呢\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that can't be Cassie. That's not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:37.81,1:45:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就是她 - 就是我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, it is. - Yeah, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.28,1:45:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是个专业的体操运动员 不可能是你\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a professional gymnast. There is no way that's you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:41.68,1:45:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是 真的是她\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, that's her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.55,1:45:44.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真乖\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:47.05,1:45:49.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真是太不可思议了 小花生\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sweetie, that's pretty amazing, peanut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.73,1:45:53.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.60,1:45:57.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,工作上的事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:57.80,1:45:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.77,1:46:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:01.98,1:46:03.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这样吧 直接说 只说事实\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here's the deal. Just give me the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.78,1:46:05.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要事实 不要别的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just the facts. Only the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:05.09,1:46:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,深呼吸 集中注意力 长话短说\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Breathe. Focus. Keep it simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.01,1:46:10.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好 没问题 没问题 来吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no. No doubt, no doubt. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.81,1:46:13.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟我表哥伊格纳西奥在一个艺术博物馆\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I'm at this art museum with my cousin Ignacio, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.31,1:46:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是一场抽象表现主义的展览\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there was this, like, abstract expressionism exhibit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.61,1:46:18.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你懂我的 其实我更喜欢新立体派主义的 是吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know me, I'm more like a Neo-Cubist kind of guy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.12,1:46:20.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但那有一副罗斯科的画简直棒呆了 伙计 天哪\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there was this one Rothko that was sublime, bro! Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.73,1:46:21.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路易斯\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Luis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.74,1:46:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 不好意思\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, sorry. Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.85,1:46:24.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我一兴奋就有点话痨的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I just get excited and stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.69,1:46:26.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不过 总之 伊格纳西奥告诉我\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But anyway, Ignacio tells me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:26.93,1:46:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我昨晚在斯波特酒吧遇见了一个\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Yo, I met this crazy-fine writer chick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.82,1:46:30.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,超级辣的美女作家 简直太辣了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"at the Spot last night. Like fine-fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:30.62,1:46:31.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,辣呀辣呀 辣得都快惹火了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Like crazy-stupid fine." And he{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:31.98,1:46:33.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他去跟酒保说\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"goes up to the bartender and goes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:33.38,1:46:35.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瞧我泡的妞 你懂我什么意思吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Look at the girl I'm with. You know what I'm sayin'?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.11,1:46:36.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她太他妈辣了 是吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"She's crazy-stupid fine, right?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.52,1:46:39.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后酒保说 是啊 真他妈辣\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bartender's all like, "Yeah, crazy-stupid fine."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.03,1:46:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后这个美女作家告诉伊格纳西奥\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So this writer chick tells Ignacio,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:41.13,1:46:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哟 我算得上是狗仔界的老大了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Yo, I'm like a boss in the world of guerrilla journalism,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:43.63,1:46:45.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟无数小道消息来源者都有密切的联系\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"and I got mad connects with the peeps behind the curtains,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.99,1:46:48.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你懂我什么意思吧 伊格纳西奥说 真的吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"you know what I'm saying?" Ignacio's like, "For real?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.40,1:46:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后她说 是啊 你知道吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she's like, "Yeah, you know what,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:49.92,1:46:51.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不能告诉你我的联系人是谁\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't tell you who my contact is,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.52,1:46:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他与复仇者们共事\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because he works with the Avengers."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.03,1:46:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.14,1:46:56.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 这家伙听起来可是个狠角色 伙计\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, and this dude sounds like a badass, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.45,1:46:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他找到她然后说\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like, he comes up to her and says,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.96,1:46:59.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要找一个道上的新人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Yo, I'm looking for this dude who's new on the scene,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.79,1:47:01.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个能快速完成任务\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"who's flashing his fresh tack,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.50,1:47:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有着爆炸般行动力的人 懂了吗 你认识这种人吗\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"who's got, like, bomb moves, right? Who you got?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.51,1:47:05.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她说 现如今我们什么样的人都有\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And she's like, "Well, we got everything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:05.82,1:47:07.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有能跳的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nowadays. We got a guy who jumps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:07.32,1:47:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,能飞的 能爬墙的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got a guy who swings, we got a guy who crawls up the walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.44,1:47:10.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得更具体点\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be more specific."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:10.74,1:47:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后他说 我在找一个能缩小的家伙\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's like, "I'm looking for a guy that shrinks."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.82,1:47:14.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当时我就觉得 我靠 我瞬间紧张了起来\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm, like, "Damn!" I got all nervous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.73,1:47:16.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我还为你保守着大秘密呢 伙计\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cause I'd keep mad secrets for you, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.34,1:47:17.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以我就问伊格纳西奥\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I asked Ignacio,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.65,1:47:19.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这个狠角色 是不是告诉这个超辣的美女作家\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Did the badass tell the stupid-fine writer chick{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.66,1:47:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要她让你告诉我 他在找蚁人\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"to tell you to tell me, because I'm tight with Ant-Man,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.87,1:47:23.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我是蚁人的好哥们\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he's looking for him?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.62,1:47:26.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢 他说什么了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And? What'd he say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.62,1:47:31.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他说 是的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said, "Yes."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:34.85,1:47:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0005,,
Dialogue: 0,1:49:26.21,1:49:28.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想给你看点东西\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I want to show you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:30.91,1:49:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我意识到力量是无法被毁灭的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I realized you can't destroy power.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:35.88,1:49:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们能做的只有保证它被对的人利用\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All you can do is make sure that it's in the right hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.29,1:49:48.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你妈和我共同研发的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is an advanced prototype{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.53,1:49:51.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,升级版战衣原型\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that your mother and I worked on together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.97,1:49:55.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她还没来得及穿上它\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She never got to use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:56.34,1:50:00.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我明白了… 其实这是我们为你而研发的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now I realize that we were... We were working on it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.35,1:50:09.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许是时候完成它了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's time we finished it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.32,1:50:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太是时候了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about damn time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:19.29,1:56:20.39,Default,,0000,0000,0001,,嗨 队长\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Cap!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:33.97,1:56:36.97,Default,,0000,0000,0001,,这要是几周前就好办得多了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This would have been a lot easier a week ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.48,1:56:39.38,Default,,0000,0000,0001,,- 如果我们告诉托尼… - 他不会相信我们的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- If we call Tony... - He won't believe us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:39.41,1:56:40.61,Default,,0000,0000,0001,,就算他信了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if he did...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.62,1:56:42.32,Default,,0000,0000,0001,,天知道协议上有没有哪条规定不让他帮忙的\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who knows if the Accords will let him help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.68,1:56:45.18,Default,,0000,0000,0001,,只能靠我们自己了\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:46.51,1:56:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0001,,或许不用\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.35,1:56:51.55,Default,,0000,0000,0001,,我认识一个家伙\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know a guy.{\r}
